      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹10.16 (up from ₹13.29 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹23.8b (up 303% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.70b (up ₹3.93b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.2% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is expected to decline by 3.9% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, while revenues in the Diversified Financial industry in India are expected to grow by 15%.",
